  "details": "Rather than having a PhysBone rotate around the head of the bone, I would like the head of the bone to lag behind as the avatar moves, then oscillate for a bit before coming to rest when the avatar stops.  \n\nIn this case, I want the entire tail to maintain its original rotation, but not its original position.  I guess essentially what I'm asking for is a type of PhysBone or setting within the PhysBone that affects the position of the bone rather than its rotation.",
